# rPeptide Environment Configuration
# Support Email Destination: Rpeptidessupport@gmail.com

# OPTIONAL: Direct Google SMTP Configuration
# If configured, emails (contact inquiries and customer orders) are sent directly via Gmail SMTP.
# To generate a Gmail App Password:
# 1. Go to Google Account > Security > 2-Step Verification > App passwords
# 2. Create an App password for "rPeptide Mail"
# 3. Add these variables in your Vercel Dashboard (Settings > Environment Variables) or .env.local:
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=465
GMAIL_USER=Rpeptidessupport@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your-16-char-app-password

# Note: If SMTP is not provided, the system automatically uses the FormSubmit serverless relay
# to deliver all orders and contact complaints directly to Rpeptidessupport@gmail.com.
